&lt;p&gt;As part of the Global Marketing Leadership team, the Director works closely with colleagues across the function. Driven by Inizio’s purpose to reimagine health, the role champions Intelligent Commercialization™ from discovery to post-launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the Marketing Events team, setting team standards as the program scales and overseeing the delivery team and its agency partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align Inizio’s event presence to the marketing strategy, ensuring a clear and consistent go-to-market presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own flagship congresses and industry events, delivering a single integrated Inizio presence at each and maintaining the master event calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide visible leadership on site at key congresses and events, as part of the global marketing leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver BU activation slots at flagship congresses centrally, and manage attendee readiness before, during and after each event&lt;/li&gt;
