 Ability to mentor colleagues informally, provide constructive review and feedback, share transaction knowledge, and help strengthen financial capability across the organization.   &nbsp;  






 Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Excel and proficiency in Microsoft Word and PowerPoint, including the ability to prepare clear financial analyses and decision materials for senior leaders and Vesper’s Board of Directors.   &nbsp;  




